WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.829
How is The Master's Edge program
different from one-on-one coaching?

2
00:00:04.829 --> 00:00:07.039
It brings four things together:

3
00:00:07.039 --> 00:00:09.003
live coaching, a structured

4
00:00:09.003 --> 00:00:12.359
curriculum, practical tools, and a
small group.

5
00:00:12.559 --> 00:00:15.187
That small group is the secret.

6
00:00:15.387 --> 00:00:17.433
When you grow alongside other

7
00:00:17.433 --> 00:00:19.561
leaders, you get momentum, new

8
00:00:19.561 --> 00:00:22.753
insight, and people who hold you
accountable.

9
00:00:22.753 --> 00:00:25.618
One-on-one coaching is built
around you.

10
00:00:25.618 --> 00:00:28.237
The program gives you
you, plus a team.

11
00:00:28.237 --> 00:00:30.447
If you're not sure which fits you

12
00:00:30.447 --> 00:00:35.030
best, book a short conversation,
and we'll figure it out together.
